        "accession_number": "0001569345-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To generate value through sustainable business solutions, we seek to design and deliver end-to-end solutions that meet the challenges of today’s digital economy, including security, data privacy, and responsible AI practices by emphasizing corporate governance, ethics, compliance, and risk management.",
        "start_character": 52860,
        "end_character": 53162
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001569345-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001569345-26-000015-896961d5a4a25e7e",
        "accession_number": "0001569345-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We anticipate that we will continue to develop select third-party relationships to help grow our business.",
        "start_character": 38407,
        "end_character": 38513
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001569345-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001569345-26-000015-896961d5a4a25e7e",
        "accession_number": "0001569345-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are subject to a variety of laws, rules and regulations in the United States and internationally, including laws regarding data privacy, protection, security, AI retention, consumer protection, accessibility, sending and storing of electronic messages (and related traffic data where applicable), intellectual property, human resource services, employment and labor laws, workplace safety, consumer protection laws, anti-bribery and anti-corruption laws, import and export controls, immigration laws, federal securities laws and tax regulations, all of which are continuously evolving and developing.",
        "start_character": 48822,
        "end_character": 49425
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001569345-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001569345-26-000015-896961d5a4a25e7e",
        "accession_number": "0001569345-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that enterprises that use multiple products from our platform are able to achieve even higher returns on investment than those that do not, and we believe that we have a significant opportunity to cross-sell and up-sell our various product offerings.",
        "start_character": 35270,
        "end_character": 35531
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001569345-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001569345-26-000015-896961d5a4a25e7e",
        "accession_number": "0001569345-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have a history of selective acquisitions that increase the breadth of our offerings and markets.",
        "start_character": 36682,
        "end_character": 36781
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001569345-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001569345-26-000015-896961d5a4a25e7e",
        "accession_number": "0001569345-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result, we have developed an advisory team that leads our Environmental, Social, and Governance (“ESG”) program and drives these initiatives company-wide.",
        "start_character": 51287,
        "end_character": 51446
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001569345-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001569345-26-000015-896961d5a4a25e7e",
        "accession_number": "0001569345-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "By investing in leadership development, recruiting top talent and refining our operational processes, we are creating an environment that reinforces our core values and enables both individual and company growth.",
        "start_character": 54574,
        "end_character": 54786
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001569345-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001569345-26-000015-896961d5a4a25e7e",
        "accession_number": "0001569345-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to this, we have developed specialized in-house LLMs to power use cases such as sentiment analysis (platform-wide), conversational analytics, automated quality management and many others.",
        "start_character": 14531,
        "end_character": 14730
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001569345-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001569345-26-000015-896961d5a4a25e7e",
        "accession_number": "0001569345-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our Wellbeing program is another way that we invest in our employees and is designed to keep our employees engaged and supported throughout their career journey at Sprinklr.",
        "start_character": 57530,
        "end_character": 57703
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001569345-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001569345-26-000015-896961d5a4a25e7e",
        "accession_number": "0001569345-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Over more than a decade, we’ve developed deep machine learning algorithms that automate insights and interactions, enabling our AI engine to process millions of structured and unstructured data points from countless channels and applications in real time.",
